{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>And as for Me, behold, I establish My covenant.</b> On this condition — that you not shed innocent blood — I establish My covenant <b>not to destroy the earth again</b>; but through the shedding of innocent blood the earth is destroyed, as it says (Numbers 35:33): כִּי הַדָּם הוּא יַחֲנִיף אֶת הָאָרֶץ וְלָאָרֶץ לֹא יְכֻפַּר וְגוֹ׳. But for all other transgressions, the sinner is punished, yet the earth is not destroyed."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:29:30.200223803Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}